   "widgets_values": [
    "## upscale.json\n\nGAN upscale (non-commercial)\n\n**Does:** x4 GAN upscale — faithful, invents nothing.\n**Trap:** `4x-UltraSharp` is **non-commercial**; for shippable output use\n`upscale-seedvr2.json` (Apache-2.0) instead.\n**Trade-off:** a GAN is faithful but soft/blurry at 2x; SeedVR2 reconstructs more detail but\ndrifts further from the source.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S9** in `HOWTO.md`  ·  Why it is this way: **E4b** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
